VNCCS-Utils adapts the geometry, attention forward and grounded encoder in
nodes/unicanvas_krea2_edit.py. The wrapper is limited to one source, encodes
before sampling, validates the target size and requires image grounding.
Public node registration, unused imports, socket metadata and logs are removed.
Model weights are separate downloads and retain their publishers' licenses.
